<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle markets quiet - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle markets quiet - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade quiet. No sales slaughter steers or slaughter heifers confirmed.</p>
<p>Inquiry and demand very light.</p>
<p>Sales confirmed this week on 83800 head, volume includes 24,100 or about 28 percent of previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
